            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For frequently seen noncomplex cancer presentation, it is important to use rapid, effective, and inexpensive radiotherapy methods. However, for the complex cancer, these sophisticated radiotherapy techniques can decrease morbidity and mortality in our transplant patients and should be considered.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
